label Greeting
if {Transaction_VisitVar} <= 50:
	Brahim: Hey there. Just taking a breather from sorting herbs with Tatay.
	Brahim: Mind helping me transcribe a quick talisman before I head back? Your hand's always steadier than mine.
else:
	Brahim: Magandang araw! Tatay asked me to prepare a fresh charm for a neighbor, and I figured I'd drop by.
	Brahim: Have a moment to help me trace this one?
[signal arg="minigame:talisman_random"]
Brahim: Salamat! That came out way cleaner than my morning attempt.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Smalltalk
if {Transaction_VisitVar} <= 50:
	Brahim: I still can't believe I used to spend my afternoons stuck in traffic instead of out here. [pause=0.3]
	Brahim: I'll head back to Tatay's before the tea gets cold. See you around!
else:
	Brahim: The breeze out front of your store is the best spot in Karimlan. [pause=0.3]
	Brahim: Better get this charm delivered while the ink's fresh. Ingat!
[end_timeline]
